note bottom of CustomOrderWorkflowService
  quote() (owner or active staff, one transaction, order row locked):
  order must be CUSTOM (409 "Chức năng này chỉ dành cho đơn hoa theo yêu cầu."), the shop must match the order (404),
  shop and owner ACTIVE (409 "Cửa hàng phải đang hoạt động."), status AWAITING_QUOTE or QUOTED (409 "Đơn không còn chờ báo giá."),
  design present, customer address and shop pickup address both have GHN codes (409).
  Shipping fee comes from GHN with a fixed weight (DEFAULT_WEIGHT_GRAM 2000 g).
  Result: subTotal = amount, totalAmount = amount + shippingFee, shopNote, status QUOTED, OrderDetail.price = amount.
  The customer gets a bell notification "Shop đã báo giá hoa theo yêu cầu" (in-app, no e-mail).
  A quoted order can be quoted again while it is still QUOTED.
end note

note bottom of ManagerOrderService
  Reject = cancel(): reason is required (400 "Vui lòng nhập lý do hủy đơn."), owner or active staff (404 / 403).
  Allowed for AWAITING_QUOTE and QUOTED (else 400 "Chỉ có thể hủy đơn hàng trước khi bắt đầu giao.").
  Order becomes CANCELLED with cancelReason, vouchers released, PENDING payments failed.
  Nothing was paid at this stage, so no Refund is created. No notification is sent to the customer.
  set-status cannot quote: AWAITING_QUOTE and QUOTED are refused (409) because they belong to the design workflow.
end note

note bottom of CustomFlowerOrderService
  Request path (status REQUESTED, see 10.3): the shop OWNER only (SHOP role) lists and opens requests
  and answers with decide(): NEGOTIATING, ACCEPTED or REJECTED (REQUESTED is refused, 400).
  ACCEPTED needs quotedPrice and depositPercent (400). ACCEPTED and REJECTED are final (409).
  The quote, note and deposit percent are stored inside desiredComponents. No Order is created and no notification is sent.
end note

@enduml
